From b70e76a8590b300853e3f5f074b05bc70fea2e02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 18:19:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 515/572] feat(stm32mp2): use scmi system power request for
 system off

Add the shutdown scmi system power request for PSCI system off request
in the function stm32_system_off().

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git a8892a1bf025f8a2d639c8597b98921214d15cd2 feat(stm32mp2): use scmi system power request for system off]
Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Id37109a76bd81ef9eef890d4c4dd84ba51a88432
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/563867
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/579535
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
---
 plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c b/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c
index bfb5854a8e..27aa6836ae 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp2/stm32mp2_pm.c
@@ -1208,6 +1208,8 @@ static void stm32_system_off(void)
 		pmic_switch_off(false);
 	}
 
+	stm32_set_scmi_sys_pwr(SCMI_SYS_PWR_SHUTDOWN);
+
 	stm32mp_ca35_lpi_isolate();
 
 	dsb();
-- 
